@startwbs ch5-mobile-tabs
skinparam shadowing false
<style>
wbsDiagram {
  FontName Arial
  FontSize 13
  node {
    BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    LineColor #333333
    RoundCorner 0
    Padding 5
    Margin 6
  }
  arrow {
    LineColor #333333
  }
  .group {
    BackgroundColor #E6E6E6
  }
}
</style>
* (tabs)/_layout.tsx: NativeTabs\n(one route group and Stack per tab)
** Every role <<group>>
*** Home tab (home)/index.tsx\nDriver: licence, badge, application\nPolice: verification hub
*** Incidents tab\n(incidents)/incidents.tsx\nmap and list
**** report.tsx (modal)\nreport incident or\nmark danger zone
*** Alerts tab\n(notifications)/notifications.tsx\nunread-count badge
*** Profile tab\n(profile)/profile.tsx\n@expo/ui components
** Driver only <<group>>
*** Fines tab\n(fines)/fines.tsx\nfine list and balance
**** fine/[id].tsx (detail)\npay or appeal
** Police only <<group>>
*** Verify tab\n(police-verify)/police-verify.tsx\nface, QR or NIC lookup
**** pushes police-driver.tsx\n(Fig. 5.1)
@endwbs
